      "research": "The department carries out active research in dry mortar mixtures for historical monument restoration based on local materials, ground cementation methods for loose soils, building green roofs in arid climates, improving thermal insulation of wall panels, and concrete technology in hot climates. Over 7 textbooks, 4 monographs, and 2 patents have been published recently.",
