        "Developing students’ socio-political and legal consciousness, and expanding their critical and analytical thinking skills;",
        "Educating students about the consequences of negative traits such as injustice, bribery, and localism;",
        "Organizing students’ leisure time meaningfully and supporting their scientific and creative activities based on their interests;",
        "Improving targeted spiritual, moral, and educational work.",
        "Establishing moral, aesthetic, political, legal, and artistic education among student youth;",
        "Organizing conferences, round tables, and meetings dedicated to promoting national customs and values;",
        "Forming ideological immunity in students against religious extremism, terrorism, drug addiction, and organized crime;",
        "Increasing youth interest in music, painting, literature, theater, and other arts, and promoting reading culture among them."
